the predicates are:
    a rule has an id *an id*.
    a rule belongs to a kb *a kb*.

the knowledge base id_test includes:
    rule mySpecialRule: a rule has an id *an id* if
        prolog le_my_id(the id).

    rule kbRule: a rule belongs to a kb *a kb* if
        prolog (le_my_kb(KB), KB:le_kb(*a kb*)).

scenario test is:
    one expects answers ["a rule has an id mySpecialRule"].
    two expects answers ["a rule belongs to a kb id_test"].

query one is:
    a rule has an id *the id*.

query two is:
    a rule belongs to a kb *the kb*.
